Configure these variables in Apache, PHP-FPM, or the hosting environment:

ALBA_STOCK_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=notifications@example.com
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_PORT=587
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_ENCRYPTION=tls
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_USERNAME=your-gmail-address@gmail.com
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_PASSWORD=your-16-character-google-app-password
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_FROM=your-gmail-address@gmail.com
ALBA_STOCK_SMTP_FROM_NAME=ALBA-GEST

Do not commit real credentials. The notification recipient is deliberately
configured separately from super-administrator account addresses.

For Gmail, use a Google app password (not your regular Google password). Enable
2-Step Verification on the Google account before generating an app password.
The SMTP username and From address must be the Gmail account that owns the app
password. Active super-administrator account addresses and any additional
addresses configured in the super-admin notification settings receive the
registration notification.
